Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.706 --> 00:00:04.656
How to be more profitable.

00:00:04.656 --> 00:00:06.848
I got a great question from one of my YouTube viewers,

00:00:06.848 --> 00:00:08.488
Ricardo, love you guys!

00:00:08.488 --> 00:00:10.286
Wrote in to say he's got a business.

00:00:10.286 --> 00:00:13.230
"Can you tell me what I can do to make it more profitable? Thank you!"

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:17.193
So, Ricardo, there's a few things you can do. Remember, if you're looking at profit,

00:00:17.193 --> 00:00:22.322
we're looking at how much we're making, our revenue, minus our costs. That gives us profit.

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:27.035
I'm not going to focus on the costs side of things, you want to try to keep your costs as low as you can.

00:00:27.035 --> 00:00:32.985
But let's focus more on the revenue side, ok? How do we bring in more business for our company?

00:00:32.985 --> 00:00:36.487
Here's a few things, I'm going to give you some tips to help you. Here we go!

00:00:36.487 --> 00:00:38.705
Number 1: Increase your prices.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:41.494
What are you charging right now and how can you increase your prices?

00:00:41.494 --> 00:00:45.004
Because most entrepreneurs, what we do is we undercut ourselves, we never charge

00:00:45.004 --> 00:00:49.026
what we're worth. You can increase your prices 20-30% and you'll end up

00:00:49.026 --> 00:00:53.851
making more money overall, even if you lose a few of your bad clients.

00:00:53.851 --> 00:00:57.523
So think about how you can increase your prices for what you charge, ok?

00:00:57.523 --> 00:01:02.136
The next thing, think about how to increase the quantity of the order.

00:01:02.136 --> 00:01:06.662
So when they're coming for you, they're coming to you once a month, whatever it is,

00:01:06.662 --> 00:01:10.507
they're spending $500. "How do I get them to spend $1,000?"

00:01:10.507 --> 00:01:13.332
How can you sell them more of what you're selling right now?

00:01:13.332 --> 00:01:16.881
Get them spending $1,000 instead of $500 every month.

00:01:16.881 --> 00:01:20.000
The 3rd thing is increase the frequency.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.838
So as they're coming once a month, how do you get them to buy from you twice a month?

00:01:23.838 --> 00:01:27.623
Get them coming back to buy the same thing more often.

00:01:27.623 --> 00:01:30.471
And then the last one is adding variety.

00:01:30.471 --> 00:01:35.169
So how can you add more products and services to what you're doing right now?

00:01:35.169 --> 00:01:41.549
So you're selling 1 thing, can you sell 2 or 3? So when someone's coming in,

00:01:41.549 --> 00:01:45.144
they're buying lots of stuff and they're coming to your place more often.

00:01:45.144 --> 00:01:48.141
So those are a few ways. Ok?

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:54.084
Profitability is important, right? You've got to make money, you've got to feed yourself.

00:01:54.084 --> 00:01:58.216
And the easiest way, typically, is increasing your prices.

00:01:58.216 --> 00:02:03.093
Offering tons of value and increasing your prices because we do, typically, tend to

00:02:03.093 --> 00:02:06.186
undercut what we bring to the table.

00:02:06.186 --> 00:02:09.977
So make sure you bring an incredible value and then charge what you're worth.

00:02:09.977 --> 00:02:15.105
But if you've done that and you're still looking to expand then look at the other options:

00:02:15.105 --> 00:02:20.053
Bigger quantities, more frequent and new products and services.

00:02:20.053 --> 00:02:21.548
Believe!

00:02:21.548 --> 00:02:23.903
For those of you watching and liked the video, thumbs up below.

00:02:23.903 --> 00:02:27.281
If you want to see more, if you have a question, you have a comment leave it below,

00:02:27.281 --> 00:02:29.054
I'll make a video response.

00:02:29.054 --> 00:02:30.612
Thank you so much! I'll see you soon.

